r Simpson County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 168% of normal in May to June and 47% in November to December. In 2026 so far, February to March came in at 48% and May to June at 164%. Grid 14560 had its driest year in 1952 at 62%.</p>"}
